<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cyberforge - Executive Attack Path & Kill Chain Incident Report</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0a0e17;
            --panel-bg: #111827;
            --panel-border: #1f293d;
            --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;
            --accent-red: #ef4444;
            --accent-amber: #f59e0b;
            --accent-emerald: #10b981;
            --text-main: #f3f4f6;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, monospace;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--panel-border);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand-title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .kpi-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .kpi-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .kpi-val {
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .kpi-lbl {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .incident-dossier {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .dossier-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            padding-bottom: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .dossier-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .badge {
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .badge-CRITICAL { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); color: var(--accent-red); border: 1px solid var(--accent-red); }
        .badge-HIGH { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: var(--accent-amber); border: 1px solid var(--accent-amber); }

        .meta-strip {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
            background: #0d131f;
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        /* Timeline Table */
        .timeline-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .timeline-table th {
            background: #162032;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: left;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }

        .timeline-table td {
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1c2638;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .timeline-table tr:hover { background: #151e2e; }

        /* Graph SVG Container */
        .graph-box {
            background: #0d131f;
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* Blast Radius Lookahead */
        .lookahead-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .lookahead-card {
            background: #141c2b;
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .lookahead-card.critical {
            border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.05);
        }

        .asset-row {
            background: #1a2436;
            border: 1px solid #283750;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .remediation-box {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #a7f3d0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <div>
            <div class="brand-title">CYBERFORGE EXECUTIVE INCIDENT REPORT</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;">
                Automated Kill Chain Reconstruction & 2-Hop Lookahead Reachability Analysis
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;">Telemetry Tier: Core (15 GB Profile)</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Generated: {{ generated_at }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- KPI Summary Bar -->
    <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-val">{{ "{:,}".format(total_events) }}</div>
            <div class="kpi-lbl">Total Events Ingested</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-val">{{ "{:,}".format(total_alerts) }}</div>
            <div class="kpi-lbl">Detections Flagged</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-val">{{ "{:,}".format(total_incidents) }}</div>
            <div class="kpi-lbl">Correlated Incidents</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-val" style="color: var(--accent-red);">{{ peak_risk_score }} / 100</div>
            <div class="kpi-lbl">Peak Threat Risk Score</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-val" style="color: var(--accent-emerald);">&lt; 1 ms</div>
            <div class="kpi-lbl">Lookahead Query Latency</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top Correlated Incidents Dossiers -->
    {% for inc in top_incidents %}
    <div class="incident-dossier">
        <div class="dossier-header">
            <div class="dossier-title">
                <span>Incident #{{ inc.incident_id }}: {{ inc.title }}</span>
                <span class="badge badge-{{ inc.severity }}">{{ inc.severity }}</span>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: {% if inc.risk_score >= 85 %}var(--accent-red){% else %}var(--accent-amber){% endif %};">
                    RISK SCORE: {{ inc.risk_score }} / 100
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Meta Strip -->
        <div class="meta-strip">
            <div><span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Compromised Host:</span> <strong style="color: #fff;">{{ inc.root_entity }}</strong></div>
            <div><span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Attributed User:</span> <strong style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">{{ inc.usr }}</strong></div>
            <div><span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Primary Threat Actor IP:</span> <strong style="color: var(--accent-amber);">{{ inc.adversary_ip }}</strong></div>
            <div><span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Active Campaign Window:</span> <strong style="color: #fff;">{{ inc.duration_minutes }} min</strong></div>
        </div>

        <!-- VISUAL 1: ATTACK PATH TIMELINE TABLE -->
        <div class="section-title">
            <span>📅</span> 1. Chronological Attack Timeline
        </div>
        <table class="timeline-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 60px;">Hop</th>
                    <th style="width: 160px;">Timestamp</th>
                    <th>Kill Chain Stage</th>
                    <th>MITRE ATT&CK Technique</th>
                    <th>Communication Flow</th>
                    <th>Evidence / Attack Signature</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for hop in inc.timeline_hops %}
                <tr>
                    <td style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-cyan);">#{{ hop.order }}</td>
                    <td style="font-family: monospace;">{{ hop.timestamp }}</td>
                    <td><span class="badge" style="background: #1e293b; color: #fff;">{{ hop.stage }}</span></td>
                    <td><strong>{{ hop.tech_name }}</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.75rem;">({{ hop.tech_id }})</span></td>
                    <td style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.8rem;">
                        <span style="color: var(--accent-amber);">{{ hop.src_ip }}</span> ──► <span style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">{{ hop.dest_ip }}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.8rem;">{{ hop.evidence }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <!-- VISUAL 2: ATTACK PATH AS A GRAPH OF HOSTS AND USERS -->
        <div class="section-title">
            <span>🕸️</span> 2. Attack Path Graph (Host, User & Infrastructure Propagation)
        </div>
        <div class="graph-box">
            <svg width="860" height="150" viewBox="0 0 860 150" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <defs>
                    <marker id="arrow-{{ inc.incident_id }}" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="5" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#06b6d4" />
                    </marker>
                </defs>

                <!-- Node 1: External Adversary -->
                <g transform="translate(60, 75)">
                    <circle r="32" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2.5" />
                    <text y="-5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ef4444" font-weight="700" font-size="11">ADVERSARY</text>
                    <text y="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fca5a5" font-family="monospace" font-size="9">{{ inc.adversary_ip[:12] }}</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Arrow 1 -> 2 -->
                <line x1="97" y1="75" x2="213" y2="75" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow-{{ inc.incident_id }})" />
                <text x="155" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#06b6d4" font-size="10" font-weight="600">Initial Exploit (T1190)</text>

                <!-- Node 2: Compromised DMZ Host -->
                <g transform="translate(250, 75)">
                    <rect x="-42" y="-32" width="84" height="64" rx="8" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2.5" />
                    <text y="-8" text-anchor="middle" fill="#06b6d4" font-weight="700" font-size="11">DMZ HOST</text>
                    <text y="8" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-family="monospace" font-size="10">{{ inc.root_entity }}</text>
                    <text y="22" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Public Facing</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Arrow 2 -> 3 -->
                <line x1="297" y1="75" x2="413" y2="75" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow-{{ inc.incident_id }})" />
                <text x="355" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#06b6d4" font-size="10" font-weight="600">PrivEsc (T1068)</text>

                <!-- Node 3: Attributed User / Privilege Account -->
                <g transform="translate(450, 75)">
                    <circle r="32" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2.5" />
                    <text y="-5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f59e0b" font-weight="700" font-size="11">USER / PRIV</text>
                    <text y="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fde68a" font-family="monospace" font-size="9">{{ inc.usr }}</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Arrow 3 -> 4 -->
                <line x1="487" y1="75" x2="603" y2="75" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow-{{ inc.incident_id }})" />
                <text x="545" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#06b6d4" font-size="10" font-weight="600">C2 Beacon (T1071)</text>

                <!-- Node 4: Exfiltration & C2 Server -->
                <g transform="translate(640, 75)">
                    <rect x="-42" y="-32" width="84" height="64" rx="8" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2.5" />
                    <text y="-8" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ef4444" font-weight="700" font-size="11">C2 EXFIL</text>
                    <text y="8" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-family="monospace" font-size="9">C2 Channel</text>
                    <text y="22" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f87171" font-size="8">5MB+ Exfiltrated</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Arrow 4 -> 5 -->
                <line x1="687" y1="75" x2="763" y2="75" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4" marker-end="url(#arrow-{{ inc.incident_id }})" />

                <!-- Node 5: Hop 2 At-Risk Blast Asset -->
                <g transform="translate(800, 75)">
                    <circle r="28" fill="#3f1212" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" />
                    <text y="-4" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ef4444" font-weight="800" font-size="10">DC 99.1</text>
                    <text y="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fca5a5" font-size="8">AT RISK</text>
                </g>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 3: WHAT THE ATTACKER COULD REACH NEXT (LOOKAHEAD BLAST RADIUS) -->
        <div class="section-title">
            <span>🔮</span> 3. Predictive Lookahead: What Could the Attacker Reach Next?
        </div>
        <div class="lookahead-grid">
            <div class="lookahead-card">
                <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                    Hop 1: Local Subnet Reachability (Immediate Peers)
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                    Direct broadcast & ARP visibility within <strong>{{ inc.root_entity[:9] }}.0/24</strong>:
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-cyan);">
                    253 Neighboring Hosts Directly Exposed
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 4px;">
                    Sample targetable nodes: {{ inc.blast_radius.hop1_sample_peers | join(', ') }}
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lookahead-card critical">
                <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-red); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                    Hop 2: High-Value Routed Assets in the Blast Radius
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                    Critical enterprise infrastructure reachable via internal routing:
                </div>
                {% for asset in inc.blast_radius.hop2_critical_assets_exposed %}
                <div class="asset-row">
                    <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #fca5a5;">{{ asset.asset }} &mdash; {{ asset.role }}</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #f87171; margin-top: 2px;">
                        Exposure Vector: <strong>{{ asset.exposure_vector }}</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 4: CONTAINMENT & REMEDIATION -->
        <div class="section-title">
            <span>🛡️</span> 4. Automated Containment & Remediation Playbook
        </div>
        <div class="remediation-box">
            <strong>Recommended Immediate Action:</strong>
            <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;">
                <li><strong>Network Isolation:</strong> Block inbound traffic from primary adversary IP <code>{{ inc.adversary_ip }}</code> on perimeter firewall (Policy Drop).</li>
                <li><strong>Host Quarantine:</strong> Isolate DMZ Host <code>{{ inc.root_entity }}</code> into quarantine VLAN to prevent Hop-2 lateral propagation to Domain Controller <code>10.10.99.1</code>.</li>
                <li><strong>Credential Revocation:</strong> Force password reset on user account <code>{{ inc.usr }}</code> and invalidate all active Kerberos tickets.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

</body>
</html>
